  "prefLabel": "Puc 1200 RESERVED",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Puc 1200 RESERVED\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nThe Department of Energy (Department) adopted Chapter En 1200 titled “Uniform Administration of Utility Customer Relations” in Document #13986, effective 5-30-24.\n\nThe Public Utilities Commission (PUC) then adopted Document #14030, effective 7-25-24, including the adoption of the former Puc 1203.05 titled “Implementation of Rate Changes” as Part Puc 1606 titled “Implementation of Rate Changes” in Chapter Puc 1600 titled “Tariffs and Special Contracts.”\n\nThe PUC subsequently adopted Document #14362, effective 9-4-25, which repealed Chapter Puc 1200, titled “Uniform Administration of Utility Customer Relations”, through the expedited repeal process pursuant to RSA 541-A:14-a, and reserved the chapter number for Chapter Puc 1200. This means that Chapter En 1200 in Document #13986 and Part Puc 1606 in Document #14030 replace all prior filings affecting the former Chapter Puc 1200. See the Revision Notes at the chapter heading for Chapter En 1200 and part heading for Part Puc 1606.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc1200.html"
